# Buyhatke

> Buyhatke is an AI shopping assistant that tracks price history, compares prices across stores, and helps shoppers find deals on Amazon, Flipkart, and 100+ other sites.

Buyhatke provides price tracking, deal discovery, grocery/flight/food/ride comparison, gift cards, and spending insights for shoppers in India and other countries.

## Products

- [Homepage](https://buyhatke.com/): Price history tracker and shopping assistant landing page
- [Price Tracker Deals](https://buyhatke.com/price-tracker-deals): Curated deals with historical price context
- [Product Lens](https://buyhatke.com/product-lens): AI product insights, ratings, and review summaries
- [Gift Cards](https://buyhatke.com/gift-cards): Buy digital gift cards with cashback
- [Grocery Price Comparison](https://buyhatke.com/grocery-price-comparison): Compare grocery prices across platforms
- [Flight Compare](https://buyhatke.com/flights): Compare flight prices and deals
- [Food Compare](https://buyhatke.com/food-compare): Compare food delivery prices
- [Ride Comparison](https://buyhatke.com/ride-comparison): Compare cab/ride prices
- [Spend Lens](https://buyhatke.com/spending-calculator): View spending across connected stores
- [Wishlist](https://buyhatke.com/wishlist): Save products and get price-drop alerts
- [Supported Stores](https://buyhatke.com/supported-stores): List of stores Buyhatke tracks

